==Old English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈlɑɣu/|lang=ang}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*laguz||water, sea}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{m|ine-pro|*lakw-||lake, pond}}. Cognate with {{cog|la|lacus||hollow, pond}}, {{cog|sga|loch||lake, pond}}, {{cog|grc|λάκκος||waterhole, pond, pit}}.

====Alternative forms====
{{l|ang|lago}}

